---
import { company } from "../../data/company";
const mail = company.serviceEmail;
---

<h2>Data controller</h2>
<p>{company.legalName}, {company.address.slice(0, 2).join(", ")}, CVR {company.cvr}.<br />Contact: <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>, {company.phone}.</p>

<h2>Cookies and local storage</h2>
<p>We do not use cookies for statistics or marketing. The site only stores your cart and your answer to the age question in your browser (localStorage). This is needed for features you use yourself and therefore needs no consent. You can delete it by clearing the site's data in your browser.</p>

<h2>What we process and why</h2>
<ul>
  <li>When you order: name, address, email, phone number and order details, so we can deliver and fulfil the contract (GDPR art. 6(1)(b)).</li>
  <li>Age check: the result of the MitID check that you are over 18, because the law requires it (art. 6(1)(c)).</li>
  <li>Accounting: order and payment details, because the Danish Bookkeeping Act requires it (art. 6(1)(c)).</li>
  <li>Enquiries: what you write to us, so we can reply (art. 6(1)(f)).</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not send newsletters or marketing.</p>

<h2>Who we share data with</h2>
<p>Our processors: hosting (Vercel), payment provider, MitID provider and carriers ({company.carriers.join(", ")}). They may only use the data on our behalf. We never sell your data.</p>

<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
<p>Order and accounting data are kept for 5 years after the end of the financial year, as the Bookkeeping Act requires. Enquiries are deleted when the matter is closed and no longer relevant.</p>

<h2>Your rights</h2>
<p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction, data portability and objection. Email <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>. You can complain to the Danish Data Protection Agency, <a href="https://www.datatilsynet.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">datatilsynet.dk</a>.</p>
